  <item>
    <title>43 你的朋友不是你的朋友|边界感|情绪价值|闺蜜|失恋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6858ec494abe6e29cb866c40</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6858ec494abe6e29cb866c40</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Jun 2025 05:58:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人到中年，朋友对你意味什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你能毫不设防地向朋友倾吐心事吗？你又能否接得住朋友汹涌而来的情绪？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是“骂醒派”还是“聆听派”？这其中要如何拿捏分寸与边界？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：许云泽，三替，雨田雨田</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加小助手微信bianyuchan，加入睡不着听友群</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期bgm：谭咏麟《朋友》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友进入不同的人生阶段后，感受、处境和经历会截然不同。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友之间的经验是可以互通的吗，沟通和理解是可以达成的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>许云泽的一位朋友正在经历分手。她提供的是怎样的安慰。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想寻求情绪价值，是找朋友，还是找心理咨询师？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">08:28</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友的安慰，反而让你愤怒。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="562">09:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你的朋友，是“骂醒派”，你会感到受伤吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友的安慰需要边界感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>不是安慰的安慰。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友的安慰中，也隐藏着暗暗的较量？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>把情绪解码成语言，已经是一种有效安慰了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>有些友谊和缘分流经你的生命，但是它不许诺停留。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>当你拥有一个心无芥蒂、完全打开的朋友，是一种什么样的体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>录播客，就是一次次地和朋友深度对话。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>自洽是不是一个伪命题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1863">31:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>你会被朋友“扰乱”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2042">34:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>接不住朋友的情绪怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">36:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>有的时候朋友的关心，也会让你有压力。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>小时候的友情是什么样的，大家又是怎么走散的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">44:42</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>那些先于爱情而来的友情。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2782">46:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>友情出现裂痕了，是要完全推倒，还是可以修复。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>陪伴本身的价值其实是最重要的。</span></p>]]></description>
